# MCP Registry domain proof

The draft server name com.cmdrvl/twinning uses domain ownership proof for
cmdrvl.com. The registry requires a public proof file at:

https://cmdrvl.com/.well-known/mcp-registry-auth

The file is served over HTTPS with a successful status and no redirect. The
maintainer generates the key pair with the MCP Registry tooling. Keep the
private key with the maintainer and outside this repository. Only the public
proof record is deployed during the separately approved GL-3 step.

This repository contains no key material and does not deploy the proof file.
Before GL-3, check the registry instructions for the current proof format and
the website's static .well-known path.
